{% doc %}
  Contact page for Signs ByLITA. Posts through Shopify's contact form.
{% enddoc %}
<article class="sbl-info sbl-info--contact">
  {% render 'sbl-info-hero',
    eyebrow: 'Customer support',
    title: 'Ask us <em>anything.</em>',
    text: "Use the form below to reach our team — it's the fastest way to get help. We usually reply the same business day.",
    aside_label: 'Support hours',
    aside_text: 'Monday – Friday · 9 AM – 6 PM Pacific'
  %}
  <div class="sbl-info-body">
    <div class="sbl-ct">
      <div class="sbl-ct-card">
        <p class="sbl-info-kicker">Preferred contact method</p>
        <h2>Send us a message</h2>
        <p>Fill out the form and our team will get back to you — usually the same business day.</p>
        {% form 'contact', id: 'SblContactForm' %}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Subject]" value="Contact form — Signs ByLITA">
          {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
            <div class="sbl-ct-status sbl-ct-status--ok" tabindex="-1" autofocus>Thank you. Your message has been sent. We'll get back to you as soon as we can.</div>
          {% elsif form.errors %}
            <div class="sbl-ct-status sbl-ct-status--err" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>Please check your email and the required fields, then try again.</div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="sbl-ct-grid">
            <div class="sbl-ct-field">
              <label for="SblContact-name">Your name <span>*</span></label>
              <input id="SblContact-name" type="text" name="contact[Name]" autocomplete="name" required value="{% if form.name %}{{ form.name }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.name }}{% endif %}">
            </div>
            <div class="sbl-ct-field">
              <label for="SblContact-phone">Your phone</label>
              <input id="SblContact-phone" type="tel" name="contact[Phone]" autocomplete="tel" value="{% if form.phone %}{{ form.phone }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.phone }}{% endif %}">
            </div>
            <div class="sbl-ct-field sbl-ct-field--full">
              <label for="SblContact-business">Business / organization (optional)</label>
              <input id="SblContact-business" type="text" name="contact[Business]" autocomplete="organization">
            </div>
            <div class="sbl-ct-field sbl-ct-field--full">
              <label for="SblContact-email">Your email <span>*</span></label>
              <input id="SblContact-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" value="{% if form.email %}{{ form.email }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.email }}{% endif %}">
            </div>
            <div class="sbl-ct-field sbl-ct-field--full">
              <label for="SblContact-topic">What can we help with? <span>*</span></label>
              <select id="SblContact-topic" name="contact[Topic]" required>
                <option value="" disabled selected>Select a topic…</option>
                <option>General question</option>
                <option>An existing order</option>
                <option>Custom sign design</option>
                <option>Ready-made signs</option>
                <option>Bulk or business order</option>
                <option>Shipping</option>
                <option>Returns</option>
                <option>Something else</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="sbl-ct-field sbl-ct-field--full">
              <label for="SblContact-order">Order number (optional)</label>
              <input id="SblContact-order" type="text" name="contact[Order number]" placeholder="If your question is about an existing order">
            </div>
            <div class="sbl-ct-field sbl-ct-field--full">
              <label for="SblContact-message">Your message <span>*</span></label>
              <textarea id="SblContact-message" name="contact[body]" required placeholder="Tell us how we can help…">{{ form.body }}</textarea>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="sbl-ct-submit" type="submit">Send message →</button>
          <p class="sbl-ct-fine">By submitting, you agree to be contacted about your inquiry. See our <a href="/pages/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        {% endform %}
      </div>
      <aside class="sbl-ct-side">
        <p>The form is the fastest way to reach our team — it lets us route your message to the right person. We typically reply the same business day.</p>
        <div class="sbl-ct-address">
          <strong>Mailing address</strong>
          Signs ByLITA<br>
          2776 Gundry Ave<br>
          Signal Hill, CA 90755
        </div>
        <div class="sbl-ct-links">
          <a href="/pages/bulk-orders">Bulk orders →</a>
          <a href="/products/custom-sign">Design a sign →</a>
          <a href="/pages/faqs">FAQ →</a>
          <a href="/pages/shipping-delivery">Shipping →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="sbl-ct-side-card">
          <h3>Same-day replies when we can</h3>
          <p>Messages received Monday to Friday during business hours are usually answered the same day. Signing a whole building? Our Bulk Orders page gets you a quote faster.</p>
        </div>
        <details>
          <summary>Prefer phone or email instead?</summary>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="tel:3105341138">(310) 534-1138</a></li>
            <li><a href="mailto:info@signsbylita.com">info@signsbylita.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </details>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-trust">
      <div><strong>Same-day replies</strong><span>Mon–Fri during business hours</span></div>
      <div><strong>Form-first support</strong><span>Fastest way to reach our team</span></div>
      <div><strong>Customized in the US</strong><span>All custom orders are personalized here</span></div>
      <div><strong>Free standard shipping</strong><span>On qualifying orders</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
